{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546218364,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c6f5ffey4sV46stYIlJse","part":{"id":"prt_1d34a2c0c0025pzpXVZu0JHBZB","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7c6f5ffey4sV46stYIlJse","messageID":"msg_1d34a0d0a0013z0EuA2be2fapH","type":"text","text":"Pre-write pass: this extends an existing function in place (`briefDelivered`) plus one helper beside `recordsHaveBrief`; a new module would fail nothing cheaper, and the task freezes this shape. Callers are `backfillRunLog` (line 379) and later the runner, both under the unchanged `boolean | 'unknown'` contract. Only `command-offer.vitest.ts` pins it.","time":{"start":1794546215948,"end":1794546218364}}}
